    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "EItKx",
      "x": 12584,
      "y": 37880,
      "name": "Storyboard Note 8",
      "fill": "$fm-ink",
      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
      "width": 1440,
      "content": "8 · REVEAL\nThe board slides away and the dinosaur glides into the hero spot, whole, never cut off at the edge. The name, the star, DUG UP, the level switch and the buttons arrive one after another, 60 ms apart. The live screen should match this layout.",
      "lineHeight": 1.45,
      "fontFamily": "Lexend",
      "fontSize": 24,
      "fontWeight": "normal"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "QEv38",
      "x": 1664,
      "y": 37880,
      "name": "Storyboard Note 1",
      "fill": "$fm-ink",
      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
      "width": 1440,
      "content": "1 · START\nAll sand, nothing showing: no cards, no outline, no hint of who is under it. Each round hides a dinosaur the child has not dug up yet, where one is left. Motion: the board drops in, the sand settles with a puff.",
      "lineHeight": 1.45,
      "fontFamily": "Lexend",
      "fontSize": 24,
      "fontWeight": "normal"
    },
