    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "jG5cJ",
      "x": 4784,
      "y": 37880,
      "name": "Storyboard Note 3",
      "fill": "$fm-ink",
      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
      "width": 1440,
      "content": "3 · BONUS FIND\nNow and then the sand holds a surprise: a shell, a tooth, a drop of amber, rarely an egg nest or a golden fossil. It glows, hops, and goes to the Field Guide. It does not end or speed the round.",
      "lineHeight": 1.45,
      "fontFamily": "Lexend",
      "fontSize": 24,
      "fontWeight": "normal"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "x1BAw",
      "x": 6344,
      "y": 37880,
      "name": "Storyboard Note 4",
      "fill": "$fm-ink",
      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
      "width": 1440,
      "content": "4 · WHO IS IT?\nAt 75% of the dinosaur uncovered the board slides left, its size unchanged, and three small look-alikes slide in on the trailing side (four at Paleontologist). The child can pick, or keep brushing for a better look. Hatchling has no question and digs to the end.",
      "lineHeight": 1.45,
      "fontFamily": "Lexend",
      "fontSize": 24,
      "fontWeight": "normal"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "LvoKY",
      "x": 7904,
      "y": 37880,
      "name": "Storyboard Note 5",
      "fill": "$fm-ink",
      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
      "width": 1440,
      "content": "5 · A WRONG PICK\nThe card shakes twice and fades; it stays out. The child digs on and picks again. No other penalty, but only a first-pick win earns the bonus star.",
      "lineHeight": 1.45,
      "fontFamily": "Lexend",
      "fontSize": 24,
      "fontWeight": "normal"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "VBsEp",
      "x": 12584,
