    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "W8hiw",
      "x": 6344,
      "y": 38260,
      "name": "Storyboard Note B",
      "fill": "$fm-ink",
      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
      "width": 1440,
      "content": "B · EMPTY SLOTS FROM THE START\nThe board never moves: the side column holds three empty slots from the first stroke, and at 75% the three dinosaurs flip in, one after another. It promises a question is coming; the cost is a narrower board from the start and three blanks the child cannot use for most of the round. Wrong and right picks then go as in 5 and 6.",
      "lineHeight": 1.45,
      "fontFamily": "Lexend",
      "fontSize": 24,
      "fontWeight": "normal"
    },
